{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_expressjs_pages_phase_0_express_basics_06_express_5_vs_4_path_rewrite", "label": "Express 5 path-to-regexp rewrite", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/expressjs/pages/phase-0-express-basics/06-express-5-vs-4.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Illegal patterns throw at registration \u2014 process fails before any request. Sandbox-measured: app.get('*') Missing parameter name; /user/:id? Unexpected ?; /*splat accepted."}, {"id": "docs_expressjs_pages_phase_0_express_basics_06_express_5_vs_4_named_splat", "label": "Named splat /*splat", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/expressjs/pages/phase-0-express-basics/06-express-5-vs-4.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SPA fallbacks that used app.get('*') must move to /*splat or /{*splat} to match the root. req.params.splat is an array of segments, not a string."}, {"id": "docs_expressjs_pages_phase_0_express_basics_06_express_5_vs_4_async_error_forwarding", "label": "Async handler rejections forward to next", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/expressjs/pages/phase-0-express-basics/06-express-5-vs-4.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rejected promises from async handlers go to error middleware. express-async-errors is an Express 4 habit. Still need try/catch to handle locally. Measured: 500 { error: 'async boom' }."}, {"id": "docs_expressjs_pages_phase_0_express_basics_06_express_5_vs_4_removed_apis", "label": "Removed Express 4 APIs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/expressjs/pages/phase-0-express-basics/06-express-5-vs-4.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "app.del, old req.param() behaviour, etc. Stay on 4 to avoid m